OL,3,GNEWSATip reopens after 'explosive
OL,4,Adevice' fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recycling centre which shut after a
OL,7,Fsuspected explosive device was found
OL,8,Fhas reopened, police said.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police was called to
OL,11,FHighbridge recycling centre, in
OL,12,FSomerset, at around 10:20 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday following reports of suspected
OL,14,Fordnance.
OL,16,FA spokesperson said a military bomb
OL,17,Fdisposal team was sent to the area, but
OL,18,Fconfirmed it was not an explosive.
OL,20,FThe force closed the site "as a
OL,21,Fprecaution" and it reopened at around
OL,22,F14:45 BST.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
